archy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSHealthProfessional.html\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">EHDSHealthProfessional</a><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">, </span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSOrganisation.html\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">EHDSOrganisation</a><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">, </span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDevice.html\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">EHDSDevice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Author of the resource.</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDeviceUse.header.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDeviceUse-definitions.html#EHDSDeviceUse.header.status\">status</a><a name=\"EHDSDeviceUse.header.status\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">1</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Current status of the device usage, e.g. active, completed.<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding Description: </span><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">HL7 Device Use Statement Status</span></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDeviceUse.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDeviceUse-definitions.html#EHDSDeviceUse.periodOfUse\" title=\"The period of time during which the device was implanted in the patient or the external device was in use.\">periodOfUse</a><a name=\"EHDSDeviceUse.periodOfUse\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#Period\">Period</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">The period of time during which the device was implanted in the patient or the external device was in use.</td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\"